 "descripcion": "Kit never put the bowl out. Each night the black dog came closer: the street, the lawn, the porch. When he finally fed it, the bowl came back with something inside.\n\n> Part 3: {when_next}.\nWould you open the door?\n\nNarrated fiction. New part every day.\n#horror #horrorstories #scarystories #survival #creepypasta",
