 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "Part two. Kit slams the *open window* shut and backs away.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "On the lawn, the black dog sits down, facing his front door.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "It stays there until sunrise, then walks away down the street.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "In the morning, the grass where it sat is dead, in a perfect circle.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Second night. No bowl again. Kit wants to prove it's just a stray.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "At 2 AM the dog is *on the porch*, breathing on the glass.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Third night. Kit's phone rings at 1:59. It's Ruth, crying.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Put the bowl out now. Please. It's at your door.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Stay, because this is the part Ruth never told the police.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Kit fills a mixing bowl with meat and opens the door a crack.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "He slides it out with his foot. He never looks up.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Something wet and hot breathes on his ankle.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then he hears it eat. Slowly. *Carefully*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "At sunrise, the bowl is back on his doormat, licked clean.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "But it isn't empty. There's something shiny at the bottom.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "A house key, covered in saliva.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Kit checks his pocket. It's *his key*. He never lost it.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "So whose key is in his pocket? Part three, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
